    {
      "term": "minx",
      "pair": [
        "minx",
        "noun",
        "轻佻的女子（过时或贬义称呼，使用时须留意语气）",
        "In the old comedy, her jealous suitor calls her a minx after she flirts with his rival.",
        "那部老喜剧中，她与情敌调情后，嫉妒的追求者便骂她是个轻佻的女子。"
      ],
      "pairSha256": "f3a23a77a540d853854a5408635dcd5c06d61e76a3d6015d949d6c6b744a28f5",
      "decision": "hold-exact-original-pair",
      "reason": "English his rival belongs to the jealous suitor; original Chinese 她与情敌 assigns the rival relation to her. Preserve original and require distinct translation child. Selected lexical sense/register itself is supportable.",
