      "pair": [
        "idiotically",
        "adverb",
        "极其愚蠢地（贬义，形容做法）",
        "I idiotically put the spare key inside the suitcase I had just locked.",
        "我竟然蠢到把备用钥匙放进了自己刚锁上的箱子里。"
      ],
      "pairSha256": "0b19613379f09f9f764ffee3ef5aa705f4fe3a53a2fda40b2692cd49c9a7a37b",
      "decision": "hold-exact-original-pair",
      "reason": "Original puts a key inside a suitcase it had just locked. An unmentioned reopening could rescue it, so not a logical impossibility; the intended locking-the-key-inside act is chronologically unclear without that extra event. Preserve original and require distinct event-clarity child.",
